<title>USA: Golden Books confirms writedowns in Q3, Q4.</title>
<headline>Golden Books confirms writedowns in Q3, Q4.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Golden Books Family Entertainment Inc reiterated Tuesday that it expects to take further writedowns in the third and fourth quarters.</p>
<p>Earlier in the day the company reported that its second quarter loss widened to $5.07 per share from year-ago losses of $0.15.  The figure included $80.1 million in restructuring and other charges.</p>
</text>
